      <purpose>*To record the findings observed during the histopathological or cytopathological examination of organs, tissues, cells, or body fluids. (en)</purpose>
      <keywords>Histopathologie, Zytologie, Pathologie, anatomische Pathologie, intraoperative Untersuchung, mikroskopische Untersuchung, makroskopische Untersuchung, Immunhistochemie</keywords>
      <use>*Use to record the findings observed during the histopathological or cytopathological examination of organs, tissues, cells, or body fluids.&#xD;
&#xD;
This archetype is designed specifically to be used in the "Test result" SLOT within the OBSERVATION.laboratory_test_result archetype, but may also be used within other ENTRY class archetypes where appropriate. (en)</use>
      <misuse>*Not to be used for reporting other types of laboratory test results, for example biochemistry or haematology.&#xD;
&#xD;
Not to be used to record a complete autopsy report, although individual tests performed on specimens collected during an autopsy may be represented using this archetype. (en)</misuse>
      <copyright>*© openEHR Foundation (en)</copyright>
    </details>
